            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, it is a wider issue in 'mini.nvim' about properly reacting to `:%bdelete`. There are safety guards for `:%bwipeout` (which I personally recommend to use over `:%bdelete`, since it has cleaner effects), but it appears not for `:%bdelete`. There are more details in the planned solution (efb7ba710731d28905f02a821346cf90577b6bec), but it will be merged not sooner than tomorrow.",
